\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Prespecified allocation sensitivity under quadratic spillover, regular32 and WS32, Bernoulli assignment. Top: RMSE (log scale); bottom: bias. Add, Quad and fixed-penalty RidgeQuad exhibit different bias--variance tradeoffs. The .5 cells reuse the main suite; .2/.8 use 200 assignments per fixed graph seed, three seeds. Error bars are approximate 95\% Monte Carlo intervals.}}{7}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:allocation}{{3}{7}{Prespecified allocation sensitivity under quadratic spillover, regular32 and WS32, Bernoulli assignment. Top: RMSE (log scale); bottom: bias. Add, Quad and fixed-penalty RidgeQuad exhibit different bias--variance tradeoffs. The .5 cells reuse the main suite; .2/.8 use 200 assignments per fixed graph seed, three seeds. Error bars are approximate 95\% Monte Carlo intervals}{figure.3}{}}
